19:["$","p",null,{"children":"判断何时应保留正确答案，本身就是 self-correction 的关键能力。若研究者用真实标签阻止 model 把正确答案改错，便给循环注入了强外部信息；这种成绩不能直接归因于 model 独立 reflection。"}]
1a:["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]
1b:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"对比有 oracle 标签和纯 intrinsic feedback 的生成—批评—再回答流程，在数学、常识和 multi-hop 问答任务上测试多个 model 与 prompt。进一步用相近调用预算的 self-consistency 方法，以及更完整的初始 prompt 作对照。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"沿用原文 GSM8K 与 CommonSenseQA 设置：先生成初答，在不告知对错的条件下要求检查并修订，最后统一用标签评分。另设 Oracle Feedback 和等量多样本等对照。输出是各类答案转移和总准确率，而非新的训练算法。原文发现部分 Model 会把原本正确的选择改错。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1c:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"设初始正确率为 a，正确答案被改错的条件概率为 p，错误答案被修正的概率为 q。一次修订后的正确率为 a(1−p)+(1−a)q。净增益是 (1−a)q−ap。因此基础 Model 越强，可供修复的错误越少，保护正确答案越重要。这是基于转移分类的教学推导，不是论文给出的不可能性定理。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"a_new = a·(1−p) + (1−a)·q\nΔa = (1−a)·q − a·p\np: Right→Wrong; q: Wrong→Right"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"假设原始 Accuracy 为 a=0.8，修订会把原来正确答案中的 p=0.1 改错，同时把错误答案中的 q=0.2 改对。保留下来的正确比例是 0.8×0.9=0.72，新救回来的比例是 0.2×0.2=0.04，合计 0.76。虽然有一些错误确实被修好，整体表现仍下降。一般地，只有救回的 (1−a)q 大于损失的 ap，Self-Correction 才产生净收益。这是由两类条件概率直接得到的分解，不是论文对所有任务使用同一 p、q 的假设。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：Intrinsic Self-correction 是否有独立收益？→ Experiment：移除 Oracle Labels，统一调用预算并改善初始 Prompt，再比较修订结果。→ Answer：在论文所测模型与推理任务中，许多设置没有收益甚至退步；结论不能外推为未来经专门训练的 Model 永远无法纠错。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"在所评估的历史 model 和 reasoning 设置中，intrinsic self-correction 通常没有稳定增益，部分实验出现性能下降。论文将问题定位到判断答案正确性的困难，而不是断言所有 feedback、所有任务或未来 model 都无法改进。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"这篇论文最有价值的结论是评价协议，而非标题的绝对语气。任何自纠错报告都应公布反馈权限、调用预算和正确答案被破坏的比例。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的外推是假定当时的固定 Model 和 Prompt 已代表全部可训练纠错能力。负结果限制的是所测条件；不同训练、可验证工具或新信息可能改变结论。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"该结论有明确的时间、model 与任务范围，不能作为新一代 model 的免检结论。作者承认可验证 external feedback，以及风格或偏好调整等任务中 self-correction 的作用；本条核读方法、结果和局限，未复现实验。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Large Language Models Cannot Self-Correct Reasoning Yet · v2","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：建立包含明确标签的 50 道推理题。Day 3–5：比较初答、无反馈修订、等预算独立采样和 Oracle 修订。Day 6–7：报告转移矩阵与置信区间，按题型分析错误，不只报告最终平均。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
21:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"要反驳广义“不可能”，可训练一个小 Model 专门识别并修复可执行算术错误，严格禁止测试标签进入 Prompt。若它在隐藏题上稳定获得正净增益，就能反驳过度外推，但不会推翻原文对当时模型的实测。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究纠错可行性的相图：以诊断准确率、反馈噪声、初始正确率和计算预算为轴，识别净增益由负转正的条件。相对 CRITIC 的工具增强与 Self-Refine 的固定循环，这目标是可预测的机制边界，而非单一 Benchmark 的新最好分数。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2303.17651",{"href":"#reference-2303.17651","aria-label":"来源 2: Self-Refine: Iterative Refinement with Self-Feedback","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2303.11366",{"href":"#reference-2303.11366","aria-label":"来源 3: Reflexion: Language Agents with Verbal Reinforcement Learning","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","2305.11738",{"href":"#reference-2305.11738","aria-label":"来源 4: CRITIC: Large Language Models Can Self-Correct with Tool-Interactive Critiquing","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
